Attested from the 17th century, of {{unk|en|nocap=1}} origin.<ref>{{R:Merriam-Webster Online|came|pos=noun}}</ref> Possibly from {{m|en|kame|t=a ridge}}.<ref>{{R:American Heritage Dictionary|came|edition=4th}}</ref> Compare {{cog|sco|came||comb}}, {{cog|sco|kame||combing; a ridge}}, and {{cog|enm|camet||silver}}.

